  howToSpot: "Anything that looks like a human, or like a PIECE of one: a whole person, a silhouette, a head, hands, arms, legs, feet, or just a black shape in a human outline. It can stand, sit, crouch or hang. If it is shaped like a person or part of a person, it is a SHADOW. Report: shadow + room."
